eotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10670812, 10670812], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}, 29366], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10670803, \"displayName\": \"HMGCS1 condenses Ac-CoA and ACA-CoA to form bHMG-CoA\", \"followingEvent\": [10670812], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HMGCS1 condenses Ac-CoA and ACA-CoA to form bHMG-CoA\", \"acetoacetyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA + H2O => (3S)-3-hydroxy-3-methylglutaryl-CoA + CoA + H(+)\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-191323\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-191323.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"XTR\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 205621, \"displayName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"name\": [\"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"Western clawed frog\", \"Silurana tropicalis\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"8364\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-191352\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-191352.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
