        "@value": "{\"category\": \"binding\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"compartment\": [{\"accession\": \"0005788\", \"className\": \"Compartment\", \"databaseName\": \"GO\", \"dbId\": 17957, \"definition\": \"The volume enclosed by the membranes of the endoplasmic reticulum.\", \"displayName\": \"endoplasmic reticulum lumen\", \"name\": \"endoplasmic reticulum lumen\", \"schemaClass\": \"Compartment\", \"url\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0005788\"}], \"dbId\": 10718934, \"displayName\": \"DBI, ACBD7 bind MCFA-CoA and LCFA-CoA\", \"evidenceType\": {\"className\": \"EvidenceType\", \"dbId\": 9990865, \"displayName\": \"inferred by electronic annotation\", \"name\": [\"inferred by electronic annotation\", \"IEA\"], \"schemaClass\": \"EvidenceType\"}, \"goBiologicalProcess\": {\"accession\": \"0006637\", \"className\": \"GO_BiologicalProcess\", \"databaseName\": \"GO\", \"dbId\": 8047, \"definition\": \"The chemical reactions and pathways involving acyl-CoA, any derivative of coenzyme A in which the sulfhydryl group is in thiolester linkage with an acyl group.\", \"displayName\": \"acyl-CoA metabolic process\", \"name\": \"acyl-CoA metabolic process\", \"schemaClass\": \"GO_BiologicalProcess\", \"url\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0006637\"}, \"input\": [{\"className\": \"Set\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10718934], \"dbId\": 10718930, \"displayName\": \"DBI, (ACBD7) [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"DBI, (ACBD7)\"], \"schemaClass\": \"CandidateSet\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-8848239\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-8848239.1\"}, {\"className\": \"Set\", \"consumedByEvent\": [10718934], \"dbId\": 8848288, \"displayName\": \"MCFA-CoA, LCFA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"MCFA-CoA, LCFA-CoA\", \"medium/long chain fatty acyl-CoA\"], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-8848288\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-8848288.2\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"DBI, ACBD7 bind MCFA-CoA and LCFA-CoA\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Complex\", \"dbId\": 10718932, \"displayName\": \"DBI,ACBD7:MCFA-CoA,LCFA-CoA [endoplasmic reticulum lumen]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 3, \"name\": [\"DBI,ACBD7:MCFA-CoA,LCFA-CoA\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10718934], \"schemaClass\": \"Complex\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-8848291\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-8848291.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"XTR\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 205621, \"displayName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"name\": [\"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"Western clawed frog\", \"Silurana tropicalis\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"8364\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-8848246\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-8848246.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping