        "@value": "3-hydroxyhexacosanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + NAD+ [peroxisomal matrix] => H+ [peroxisomal matrix] + NADH [peroxisomal matrix] + 3-ketohexacosanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix]"
