        "@value": "NADPH [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] + O2 [mitochondrial matrix] + 22b-HCHOL [mitochondrial inner membrane] => NADP+ [mitochondrial matrix] + H2O [mitochondrial matrix] + 20a,22b-DHCHOL [mitochondrial inner membrane]"
