        "@value": "(S)-3-Hydroxyhexadecanoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + NAD+ [mitochondrial matrix] => NADH [mitochondrial matrix] + 3-Oxopalmitoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix]"
