        "@value": "11DCORT [mitochondrial matrix] + NADPH [mitochondrial matrix] + O2 [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix] => NADP+ [mitochondrial matrix] + H2O [mitochondrial matrix] + CORT [mitochondrial matrix]"
