        "@value": "NAD+ [cytosol] + Cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,27-triol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] => 4CHOL7a,27DONE [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + NADH [cytosol] + H+ [cytosol]"
