to AT-RvD1 or AT-RvD2\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Set\", \"dbId\": 9024574, \"displayName\": \"AT-RvD1, AT-RvD2 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 2, \"name\": [\"AT-RvD1, AT-RvD2\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10727508], \"schemaClass\": \"DefinedSet\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9024574\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9024574.1\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10727514, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7(S)-Hp-17R-HDHA to 7S(8)-epoxy-17R-HDHA\", \"followingEvent\": [10727508], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7(S)-Hp-17R-HDHA to 7S(8)-epoxy-17R-HDHA\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-9020256\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-9020256.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"XTR\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 205621, \"displayName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"name\": [\"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"Western clawed frog\", \"Silurana tropicalis\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"8364\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Xenopus tropicalis\", \"stId\": \"R-XTR-9020252\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-XTR-9020252.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</