        "@value": "CoA-SH [mitochondrial matrix] + ATP [mitochondrial matrix] + CH3COO- [mitochondrial matrix] => PPi [mitochondrial matrix] + AMP [mitochondrial matrix] + Ac-CoA [mitochondrial matrix]"
